  "releaseNotes": "- Bug fix: fixed bug in DWG reading of layer causing CadLib not understanding that the \"0\" layer is the zero layer, affecting the rendering. This broke in version x.0.2025.04241 during refactoring.\n- Bug fix: CTB produced incorrect colors. Whether to use the object color or the plot style color was not correctly determined.",
